# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
#
# The site is a single-page app with two language routes. "200" means
# rewrite: the URL stays /es-mx/ or /en/ but Pages serves the home page
# (index.html), so reloading those pages never returns 404.
#
# Rewrite to "/" and not "/index.html": Pages redirects /index.html to /
# (308), so a rewrite pointing at it never serves the page.
#
# Any other unknown path falls through to /404.html (served with status 404).

/es-mx    /es-mx/  301
/en       /en/     301
/es-mx/*  /        200
/en/*     /        200
